  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd"><html dir="ltr" lang="en"><head><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"/><meta name="color-scheme" content="light only"/><meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light only"/><title>Let’s fix Maplewood’s roads</title><style>:root{color-scheme:light only;supported-color-schemes:light only}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){.em-bg{background-color:#E9F2F5 !important}.em-card{background-color:#FFFFFF !important}.em-header{background-color:#0E7490 !important}.em-rule{background-color:#0E7490 !important}.em-band{background-color:#E9F2F5 !important}.em-divider{background-color:#E4E4E7 !important}.em-accent{background-color:#0E7490 !important}.em-cta{background-color:#0E7490 !important}.em-header-text{color:#FFFFFF !important}.em-headline{color:#1E1F20 !important}.em-subheading{color:#0E7490 !important}.em-body{color:#3E4042 !important}.em-meta{color:#595C5F !important}.em-cta-text{color:#FFFFFF !important}.em-cta-link{color:#0E7490 !important}.em-accent-text{color:#FFFFFF !important}}@media only screen and (max-width:620px){.em-pad{padding-left:20px !important;padding-right:20px !important}.em-page{padding-left:0 !important;padding-right:0 !important}}</style></head><body bgcolor="#E9F2F5" class="em-bg" style="background-color:#E9F2F5;margin:0;padding:0"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><!--body--><table border="0" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" align="center"><tbody><tr><td style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#E9F2F5;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#E9F2F5" class="em-bg" style="background-color:#E9F2F5;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="left" bgcolor="#E9F2F5" class="em-bg em-page" style="background-color:#E9F2F5;padding:24px 12px;text-align:left"><table role="presentation" width="600" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="em-card" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background-color:#FFFFFF;margin:0 auto"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="em-card" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="left" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="em-card em-pad" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:48px 48px;text-align:left"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%"><tbody><tr><td style="padding-top:0"><img alt="A cracked street in Maplewood" src="https://app.goodparty.org/images/email-samples/street.jpg" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%;max-width:504px;height:auto;border-radius:8px" width="504"/></td></tr><tr><td style="padding-top:32px"><h1 class="em-headline" style="margin:0;color:#1E1F20;font-size:24px;line-height:29px;font-weight:600">Let’s fix Maplewood’s roads, together</h1></td></tr><tr><td style="padding-top:32px"><p class="em-body" style="font-size:16px;line-height:26px;margin:0;color:#3E4042;text-align:left;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0"><span>Hi {{first_name}}, I’m running for City Council because Maplewood’s roads have waited long enough. I’ll be knocking on doors this month and I’d love to hear what matters to you.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding-top:32px"><img alt="" src="https://app.goodparty.org/images/email-samples/hills.jpg" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%;max-width:504px;height:auto;border-radius:8px" width="504"/></td></tr><tr><td style="padding-top:32px"><p class="em-body" style="font-size:16px;line-height:26px;margin:0;color:#3E4042;text-align:left;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0"><span>Reply and tell me which street needs work first. I read every message, and I’ll walk it myself before the next town meeting.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding-top:32px"><table role="presentation" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" align="center" style="margin:0 auto"><tbody><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#0E7490" class="em-cta" style="background-color:#0E7490;border-radius:6px"><a href="https://example.org/dana-ortiz/volunteer" class="em-cta-text" style="color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration-line:none;display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:24px;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Volunteer with Dana</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding-top:32px"><p class="em-headline" style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 4px;color:#1E1F20;font-weight:600;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0">Dana Ortiz</p><p class="em-body" style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 4px;color:#3E4042;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0"><span>Candidate for City Council</span></p><table role="presentation" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 0"><tbody><tr><td style="padding-right:4px;vertical-align:middle"><img alt="GoodParty.org" height="12" src="https://app.goodparty.org/images/email-samples/goodparty-heart.png" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;width:15px;height:12px" width="15"/></td><td style="vertical-align:middle"><a href="https://goodparty.org/people/dana-ortiz-1a2b3c4d" class="em-cta-link" style="color:#0E7490;text-decoration-line:none;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">My public profile</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#E4E4E7" class="em-divider" style="background-color:#E4E4E7;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="left" bgcolor="#E4E4E7" class="em-divider" height="1" style="background-color:#E4E4E7;padding:0;text-align:left;height:1px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px"> </td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="em-card" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="left" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="em-card em-pad" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:24px 32px 32px;text-align:left"><p class="em-meta" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#595C5F;text-align:left;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">Paid for by Wells for Mayor</p><p class="em-meta" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#595C5F;text-align:left;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">You’re getting this email because you asked to hear from Renee Wells.</p><p class="em-meta" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#595C5F;text-align:left;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">916 Silver Spur Rd #310, Rolling Hills Estates, CA 90274</p><p class="em-meta" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0;color:#595C5F;text-align:left;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0"><a href="{{unsubscribe_url}}" ses:no-track="" class="em-meta" style="color:#595C5F;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
  "subject": "Let’s fix Maplewood’s roads",
  "text": "Let’s fix Maplewood’s roads, together

Hi {{first_name}}, I’m running for City Council because Maplewood’s roads have waited long enough. I’ll be knocking on doors this month and I’d love to hear what matters to you.

Reply and tell me which street needs work first. I read every message, and I’ll walk it myself before the next town meeting.

Volunteer with Dana https://example.org/dana-ortiz/volunteer

Dana Ortiz

Candidate for City Council

My public profile https://goodparty.org/people/dana-ortiz-1a2b3c4d

 

Paid for by Wells for Mayor

You’re getting this email because you asked to hear from Renee Wells.

916 Silver Spur Rd #310, Rolling Hills Estates, CA 90274

Unsubscribe {{unsubscribe_url}}",
}
`;

