share your view with the council.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding-top:32px"><p class="em-headline" style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 4px;color:#1E1F20;font-weight:600;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0">Carla Reyes</p><p class="em-body" style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 4px;color:#3E4042;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0"><span>City Council Member<br/></span><span>Maplewood, District 4</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#E4E4E7" class="em-divider" style="background-color:#E4E4E7;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="left" bgcolor="#E4E4E7" class="em-divider" height="1" style="background-color:#E4E4E7;padding:0;text-align:left;height:1px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px"> </td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="em-card" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;width:100%"><tbody><tr><td align="left" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="em-card em-pad" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:24px 32px 32px;text-align:left"><p class="em-meta" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#595C5F;text-align:left;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">You’re getting this email because you asked to hear from Renee Wells.</p><p class="em-meta" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#595C5F;text-align:left;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">916 Silver Spur Rd #310, Rolling Hills Estates, CA 90274</p><p class="em-meta" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0;color:#595C5F;text-align:left;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0"><a href="{{unsubscribe_url}}" ses:no-track="" class="em-meta" style="color:#595C5F;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
  "subject": "Maple Ave and Lincoln Park on the December 8 agenda",
  "text": "Two decisions coming to the council

Hi {{first_name}}, at our December 8 meeting the city engineer presents the Maple Ave traffic calming study, and we decide on building the Lincoln Park splash pad. I’d love to hear what you think before then.

The meeting starts at 7:00 PM at City Hall, 200 Main St, and public comment comes right after the consent agenda. If you can’t come, reply to this email and I’ll share your view with the council.

Carla Reyes

City Council Member
Maplewood, District 4

 

You’re getting this email because you asked to hear from Renee Wells.

916 Silver Spur Rd #310, Rolling Hills Estates, CA 90274

Unsubscribe {{unsubscribe_url}}",
}
`;
